{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>\u3010Nemesis System\u3011</strong><br>\u2022 Each knight has <strong>1 evolving Nemesis</strong> that adapts to your tactics<br>\u2022 Defeat them to uncover <strong>forbidden truths</strong> about the fallen Church</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd2e <strong>\u3010Match-3 Tactics Depth\u3011</strong><br>\u2022 <strong>Chain Combos</strong>: 3-match \u2192 5-match triggers phase shifts<br>\u2022 <strong>Holy Infusion</strong>: Drag to convert rune types</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>\u3010Meta Progression Web\u3011</strong><br>\u2022 Global level unlocks <strong>new heroes, dungeon layers, black market</strong><br>\u2022 30+ relics <strong>break game rules</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;A <strong>solo odyssey</strong> into darkness.<br>You'll witness\u2014<br>\u2022 The Radiance Knight shatter from purity<br>\u2022 The Blood Oath Knight consumed by vengeance<br>\u2022 The Masked Knight forgetting his own face<br>...Now, it's your turn.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3813260?t=1750125581","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3813260?t=1750125581","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813260/a8dd8307569c1f55d1fbc515860d065ae6b6093e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750125581","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813260/a8dd8307569c1f55d1fbc515860d065ae6b6093e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750125581","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>\u3010Nemesis System\u3011</strong><br>\u2022 Ea